Project Origin, Heritage & Upgradation Attribution:
VaakKavach (वाक्कवच) is an advanced evolution, complete architectural overhaul, and upgraded edition of the original project AEGIS (https://github.com/Ashu-1126/AEGIS). The original AEGIS prototype was developed as a collaborative team project by IronLogic, of which Mohammad Huzaifa is a member. Following the collaborative work, Mohammad Huzaifa independently branched, redesigned, upgraded, modularized into an autonomous on-device edge AI defense shield, and developed this new platform (https://github.com/GuruMachanica/VaakKavach) as the sole engineer.

