3. **No Derivative Works or Forks**: You may not create, compile, distribute, publish, or sublicense any derivative works, modified builds, forks, plugins, or complementary extensions derived from this codebase.
4. **No Pipeline or Model Integration**: You may not extract or integrate any subcomponents of VaakKavach—including the acoustic neural network model weights/loaders, local risk scoring rules, WebRTC VAD audio chunkers, regex intent scanners, or forensic report generators—into third-party applications, commercial bots, security products, or API gateways.
5. **No Commercial Exploitation**: You may not sell, lease, rent, license, sub-license, commercialize, or use this software, models, or documentation to generate direct or indirect revenue.
6. **No Asset or UI Theft**: You may not reuse any visual assets, logos, risk radar gauges, waveform widgets, design systems, UI components, animations, color palettes, or branding elements created for VaakKavach.
7. **No Reverse Engineering or Penetration Attacks**: You may not reverse-engineer, decompile, disassemble, or extract weights/parameters from the models or mobile client. You are strictly forbidden from performing penetration testing, vulnerability scanning, fuzzing, or DDoS/DoS simulations against active infrastructure.
8. **No AI / LLM Model Training**: This codebase, including all source files, documentation, model architectures, datasets, and comments, must not be used as training inputs, fine-tuning corpora, or scraped to train Large Language Models (LLMs), code synthesis agents, developer assistants, or generative AI models without written consent.
